## Schema

### Required

- `provisioned` (Number) Provisioned storage in bytes. Must be a positive multiple of 1073741824 (1 GiB).
- `tenant_id` (String) Key of the parent `vergeio_tenant`. Changing it replaces the allocation.
- `tier` (Number) Storage tier key. Changing it replaces the allocation.

### Read-Only

- `allocated` (Number) Allocated storage in bytes.
- `id` (String) Tenant storage key assigned by VergeOS.
- `last_update` (Number) Last usage update as a Unix timestamp.
- `used` (Number) Used storage in bytes.
- `used_pct` (Number) Percentage of provisioned storage that is used.

## Import

Import is supported using the tenant storage key.

```shell
terraform import vergeio_tenant_storage.example <id>
```
